OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 2015, the Fundao dam collapsed
OL,14,     Fnear Mariana in Brazil, causing a
OL,15,     Fmajor environmental disaster.
OL,16,     FPaula Geralda Alves recalls racing
OL,17,     Fthrough her village to warn
OL,18,     Fpeople.
